# Converter fixtures are binary containers whose exact bytes the certified tests
# assert (page counts, extracted character counts and "is_repaired=False" all
# depend on it).  With core.autocrlf=true and no rule here, git auto-detects the
# plain-text-looking PDF streams as text and rewrites their line endings on every
# fresh checkout: the bytes change, and a fixture MuPDF used to read cleanly can
# come back as a repaired document.  Pin them as binary.
#
# Scoped deliberately to the fixtures this batch adds; existing tracked PDFs keep
# their current behaviour so this change cannot make another working tree dirty.
tests/fixtures/pdf_to_epub/*.pdf binary
